# Lighthouse CI local artifacts (regenerated on every run; CI uploads
# to temporary-public-storage instead). Wildcard catches the
# `.perftest` / `.prod` / `.prod-post-slim` ad-hoc renames done
# during 3C/3D to keep parallel runs from clobbering each other.
